# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
# Substitua pelo JWT válido
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN
# Substitua pelo ID do pedido que exista e esteja PENDING_PAYMENT
@orderId = ORDER_ID_HERE
# Substitua pelo ID do pagamento do Mercado Pago (data.id do webhook)
@mpPaymentId = MP_PAYMENT_ID_HERE
# Substitua pelo ID interno do pagamento retornado na criação
@paymentId = PAYMENT_ID_HERE
# Assinatura HMAC calculada sobre o corpo do webhook com MP_WEBHOOK_SECRET
@signature = SIGNATURE_HEX_LOWERCASE

### Iniciar pagamento (alias /api/payments/create)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/create
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "PIX",
  "payerData": {
    "email": "cliente@example.com",
    "name": "Cliente Teste"
  }
}

### Iniciar pagamento (rota original /api/payments)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "PIX",
  "payerData": {
    "email": "cliente@example.com",
    "name": "Cliente Teste"
  }
}

### Webhook Mercado Pago com validação HMAC (/webhooks/mercadopago)
# Observação:
# - Calcule {{signature}} = HMAC-SHA256(hex) do corpo abaixo usando MP_WEBHOOK_SECRET
# - Envie exatamente o corpo usado para calcular a assinatura
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/mercadopago
Content-Type: application/json
x-signature: sha256={{signature}}
x-request-id: test-req-123

{
  "type": "payment",
  "data": { "id": "{{mpPaymentId}}" }
}

### Webhook Mercado Pago na rota antiga (/api/payments/webhook)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/webhook
Content-Type: application/json
x-signature: sha256={{signature}}

{
  "type": "payment",
  "data": { "id": "{{mpPaymentId}}" }
}

### Consultar status do pagamento
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/{{paymentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Checkout API - PIX (gera QR para o cliente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "PIX",
  "payerData": {
    "email": "cliente@example.com",
    "identification": { "type": "CPF", "number": "12345678901" }
  },
  "paymentData": {}
}

### Checkout API - Cartão (requer token gerado no frontend)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/payments/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "method": "CREDIT_CARD",
  "payerData": {
    "email": "cliente@example.com",
    "identification": { "type": "CPF", "number": "12345678901" }
  },
  "paymentData": {
    "token": "CARD_TOKEN_FROM_FRONTEND",
    "installments": 1,
    "issuer_id": null,
    "payment_method_id": "visa"
  }
}
